; Regression test: compile_gaussian must compile `mu` and `sigma` under
; *distinct* strict_order_index values. The two flips below are distinct
; random choices with identical parameters at identical relative callstack
; positions; if both children are compiled at the same index, the flips
; collapse into a single BDD variable and the posterior mixture has only
; the (mu=0, sigma=1) and (mu=3, sigma=2) components at p=0.5 each,
; instead of all four (mu, sigma) combinations at p=0.25 each.
(query
  (Posterior
    (gaussian (if (flip 0.5) 0.0 3.0)
              (if (flip 0.5) 1.0 2.0))
    True))
